# Found verifying #1397: in Deferred with SSR on, an upscale toggle resized
# the SSR history inside PopulateBlackboard, which re-populated the
# blackboard under a cached graph; GTAO and AOApply then resolved stale
# handles.
olo-state-machine-trace 1
seed 0
initial path=forward size=320x180 msaa=1 upscale=off features= blended=0 buffering=2 pose=0
op path deferred
op feature ssr on
op feature gtao on
op upscale performance
op upscale off
op upscale quality
op upscale off
